# A fourth rare line for each of the six Enhanced villagers, bringing the plan's rare-line count to 48. Compiled to zz_fs_rare_extra.json.

addto npc.marcus.talk
0 ~ => marcus.rare.4 cat=rare rarity=rare tag=funny :: Every plank I've ever cut has a name. This one's Gerald. Don't ask. Gerald is straight.

addto npc.odalys.talk
0 ~ => odalys.rare.4 cat=rare rarity=rare tag=wholesome :: I don't sleep much. I'm told that's irony. I call it a long shift with good company.

addto npc.felix.talk
0 ~ => felix.rare.4 cat=rare rarity=rare tag=funny :: I named my favorite fish Tuesday. She's been gone for years. Every Tuesday, I look for her.

addto npc.dorian.talk
0 ~ => dorian.rare.4 cat=rare rarity=rare tag=wholesome :: ...There's an owl by my hut. We don't speak. We have an understanding. It's perfect.

addto npc.elara.talk
0 ~ => elara.rare.4 cat=rare rarity=rare tag=funny :: I once knitted a scarf so long it went around the clinic twice! Dr. Penn used it as a hallway!

addto npc.ione.talk
0 ~ => ione.rare.4 cat=rare rarity=rare tag=wholesome :: A book once fell off the shelf exactly when I needed it. I've never moved it. It's still there.
